---
description: Sanity schema, GROQ, and talk-vs-event IA
globs: apps/studio/**,apps/web/src/lib/sanity/**
alwaysApply: false
---

Guide: `docs/sanity-guide.md`. Workflow: `.cursor/skills/sanity-content/SKILL.md`. Prefer the Sanity MCP over guessing.

- Talk = timeless bookable topic. Event = dated edition; `sessions[]` carry the role (speaker/workshop/host/attendee…) and the recording/slides. Do not model an upcoming gig as a talk.
- New schema fields must be projected in the matching loader in `apps/web/src/lib/sanity/v3/` or they never appear on the site. Shared option lists: `packages/shared/src/content-model.ts`.
- Loaders are failure-tolerant and read legacy V2 shapes too. Empty CMS is an empty state, not a 500. Content cleanup: `docs/sanity-mcp-prompts.md`.
- Country names on events: standard English (`Czechia`). They drive flag emojis.
- Do not bake editorial copy into components when it belongs in Studio.
